 "_comment": "MaluMail's directory fixture for the proofs without a kernel (testing-without-a-kernel.md): claims as the hand-off carries them (bin/dev_handoff.php <id>) and a full change feed (bin/directory_sync.php --from-file). Every actor of design §2: 1 the owner (super-admin, IT; Mail admin — runs MaluMail, never opens a person's mailbox by it); 26 Priya a Mail user (Sales); 27 Marco given the Mail admin role who is NOT a super-admin (Finance, its admin and manager — D2: refused every admin right, told why; a Mail user's rights kept); 28 Bea a Mail user whose roles have not arrived (Accounting, capability write — read as Mail user); 29 Ann an external holding a role MaluMail does not publish (`viewer` — dropped; capability read — no role at all, fail closed); 30 Dana a Mail user who will oversee an agent's mailbox (Sales — oversight is a level, not a role); 31 Lee in Sales holding read whose roles have not been sent (no role — MaluMail has no read-only role); 40 the Mail Expert, an agent granted Mail user; 41 Watcher an agent not admitted; 42 the Mail Clerk, an agent granted Mail user; 43 Ada an agent the Mail admin role was given to (refused every admin right — an agent never administers). Names are SMOKE so a proof's leftovers are recognised.",
